/**
 * Example entry point: connects to MySQL and runs a query, printing the rows.
 * Pass a SQL statement as arguments to run your own, e.g.
 * {@code mvn exec:java -Dexec.args="SELECT NOW()"}. Only read-only queries are
 * executed here.
 */
